Z||000004||Greg Piet||10-30-1999||03:27 AM||||Ive been looking for a better ignition system.  My little car just got a rebuild distributor, but now it is misbehaving.  Either my timing is floating or my coil is going south. <P>I also want strokers kit, so Ive been trying to find a compatible ignition system.<P>I found a MSD 6BTM @   <A HREF="http://www.re-racing.com/html_docs/msd-6series.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.re-racing.com/html_docs/msd-6series.htm</A> <BR>which does retard depending on the amount of boost.<BR>Any opinions.<P>Also I was going to get a MSD coil, but on teh above page it lists a HEI coil and a HEI module, but one can only be used on "non computer HEI Distrubutors"  Our distributor goes to the computer so can I use the coil MS-8225, and do i need the module?<P>Im like gettting confused and stuff!||||reg||1
Z||000005||TOM||10-30-1999||10:53 AM||||6BTM is an excellent choice. There is a coil that is a direct replacment for ours. Its not listed there but I have seen it.||||reg||1
Z||000006||DXR_DAD||10-30-1999||11:16 PM||||Greg, check your JEG'S  (GM Blaster #8226)  (GM Blaster SS #8207) These two coils will work with the fiero stock system.||||reg||1
